{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/7134932/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はアンケートに回答していただいてありがとうございました(^^)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーいいね楽しいねえ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会であったことあるよって方はもちろんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだあったことないーって方のことも色々知れるね!にやにや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーわけでこれからも、たくさん質問していくのでよろしくね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめきゅんさん大辞典作るのさー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご協力よろしくね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の質問(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失礼ながら...何歳ー??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.ひめたんと同じくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.ひめたんのお兄さんお姉さんくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.ひめたんのぱぱままくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4.ひめたんのおじいちゃんおばあちゃんくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5.ゆみ姉と同じ永遠の17歳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6.その他"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待ちしてまーすよ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー順次公開中の乃木坂って、ここ!第3弾も公開されましたねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう見ていただけたかな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか(伊藤万理華chan)がめっちゃ頑張ってたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/7134932/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか。いいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/7134932/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜ、題名が、いつも2012年2月??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはずばり!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2012年に一度答えた質問を載せてるから(わら)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/7134932/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん大図鑑、大百科との違いは何?(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"図鑑と百科ー??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両方きいたことあるけど、違いな何なんだろうね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかして、今まで頑張って作ってきたやつは「図鑑」でなく「百科」てことも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なきにしもあらず...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わっかんね('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"百科なんておうちにもないからな...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやったら辞書で調べてみるしかー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/7134932/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこに出没してることが多いですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/7134932/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プライベートでよくいくとこ教えてー☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段は通学路しか通らないってゆーね(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は放課後みんな忙しいから、友達と遊びに行ったりとかないのよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休日はーどこだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷とかも好きだし、お台場とかも好きだし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/7134932/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが一番落ち着く場所はドコですか?(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は教室すき!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おうちのお布団の中も落ち着くかなー(^ω^)ぽ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/7134932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月並みな質問ですが街角で芸能人に会ったことありますか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またファンの人に発見されたことありますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういやないねー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんお仕事とプライベートは完璧に切り離したりされてるんですかね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーちなみにひめたんが発見されないのはオーラがないんだと思ふ('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/7134932/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺の手で、ひめきゅんを一人増やしたぜ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、いつも応援してくれてありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもひめきゅん増殖させるよー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも、よかったら、どうかご協力を...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/7134932/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問なんですが、もしかしてスクールオブロック聴いてますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオは聴いてなーいです('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組のこと、知ってはいるけどねん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/7134932/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のおいでシャンプーのPV、100点満点中、何点??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼は頑張ったから75点!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVは自信ないからなー(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/7134932/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめた〜んに質問、化粧水なに使ってるかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"proactiv(プロアクティブ)ってご存知かな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それ使ってるよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニキビで悩んでる人にはおすすめなんだけど、刺激が強いから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肌が弱い人はどうかなー合うかなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんにはぴったり☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}